  "synopsis": "In this world of half-orcs, everyone looks like a human but retains animalistic features, and the inhabitants live peaceful lives. Novelist Su Bai travels to his good friend You Nanxia's hometown, a secluded mountain village—Xiaoshuijing Village—a modern and vibrant terraced paradise, where he meets the lively and adorable Tu Niannian. Farming, harvesting, enjoying delicious food, catching fish… daily life in the mountains is always full of fun.\n\n(Source: Bangumi, translated)",
